{"channelId":"UCQfuVTFgdPvZzINuSsiDEAA","row":["Dr. Carl Baird",50000,"I’m Dr. Carl Baird — chiropractor and strength coach — and I help adults 40+ overcome joint pain and arthritis so they can stay active and enjoy life. For the past 12 years, I’ve guided adults in building strength and improving movement — the most powerful way to reduce pain and maintain your lifestyle as you age.\n\nOn this channel, I show you safe, effective ways to strengthen your body while limiting stress on your joints, so you can stay mobile, active, and confident.\n\nMy mission is simple: to help you live stronger, healthier, and happier. I’m excited you’re starting your strength journey with me — let’s get moving!\n\nStay Strong,\nDr. Carl Baird","drbaird@solvingpainwithstrength.com","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCQfuVTFgdPvZzINuSsiDEAA","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCQfuVTFgdPvZzINuSsiDEAA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:21:37.454Z","channelId":"UCQfuVTFgdPvZzINuSsiDEAA","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"401ae919fc9f8d6910b849e497d51bbd10f5b67da8774093ca55be5d3cdae6be","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"76c246d4bd5b31d846c26250c245da4618d748bde5fe5c6ae26cb7f384ee78e8"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCQfuVTFgdPvZzINuSsiDEAA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:21:37.454Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCQfuVTFgdPvZzINuSsiDEAA","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":50000,"raw":"50K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCQfuVTFgdPvZzINuSsiDEAA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:21:37.454Z"}],"emails":[{"address":"drbaird@solvingpainwithstrength.com","purpose":"unknown","ownerRole":"unknown","identityStatus":"cross_linked","sourceUrls":["https://www.solvingpainwithstrength.com/","https://www.solvingpainwithstrength.com/about","https://www.solvingpainwithstrength.com/blog/the-health-benefi